# SHA-256 of each lowercased blocked employer term, one per line.
# A term is one word or two words joined by a single space, where a word is a
# run of [a-z0-9]. scripts/check_no_employer_data.py hashes every word and
# every adjacent word pair in tracked files and fails on a match.
# Add a term: printf '%s' 'term in lowercase' | sha256sum
